      "cleanSource": "\u0026WWPUserExtended.Load(WWP_GetLoggedUserId())\n\t\u0026WWPUserExtended.WWPUserExtendedDesktopNotif = \u0026Desktop\n\t\u0026WWPUserExtended.Save()\n\tIf \u0026WWPUserExtended.Success()\n\t\tCommit\n\tEndIf"
